{
 "id": "pep39",
 "title": "The Museum",
 "source": "peppa-s1-en-srt + zh-translation",
 "note": "英文人工 SRT 与中文翻译逐条对齐；纯音效/水印行已剔除。",
 "lines": [
  {
   "start": 4.0,
   "end": 8.302,
   "en": "I'm Peppa Pig, this is my little brother George,",
   "i": 1,
   "zh": "我是佩奇，这是我的弟弟乔治，"
  },
  {
   "start": 8.326,
   "end": 12.012,
   "en": "this is Mummy Pig, and this is Daddy Pig.",
   "i": 2,
   "zh": "这是猪妈妈，这是猪爸爸。"
  },
  {
   "start": 13.0,
   "end": 15.0,
   "en": "Peppa Pig",
   "i": 3,
   "zh": "小猪佩奇"
  },
  {
   "start": 18.15,
   "end": 20.0,
   "en": "The Museum",
   "i": 4,
   "zh": "博物馆"
  },
  {
   "start": 21.0,
   "end": 24.0,
   "en": "Peppa and her family are going to the museum.",
   "i": 5,
   "zh": "佩奇和她的家人要去博物馆。"
  },
  {
   "start": 26.95,
   "end": 29.0,
   "en": "Daddy, what is a museum?",
   "i": 6,
   "zh": "爸爸，什么是博物馆？"
  },
  {
   "start": 30.1,
   "end": 34.0,
   "en": "It's a place full of interesting things that are very old.",
   "i": 7,
   "zh": "这是一个充满有趣事物的地方，而且很古老。"
  },
  {
   "start": 34.001,
   "end": 35.0,
   "en": "Older than you?",
   "i": 8,
   "zh": "比你大？"
  },
  {
   "start": 35.001,
   "end": 38.0,
   "en": "Yes, even older than me.",
   "i": 9,
   "zh": "是的，甚至比我还大。"
  },
  {
   "start": 38.349,
   "end": 41.0,
   "en": "Oooh, really old!",
   "i": 10,
   "zh": "哎哟，真老了！"
  },
  {
   "start": 42.875,
   "end": 47.0,
   "en": "There's one room full of things that belonged to kings and queens from long ago.",
   "i": 11,
   "zh": "有一个房间，里面装满了很久以前属于国王和王后的东西。"
  },
  {
   "start": 47.249,
   "end": 50.0,
   "en": "I went to see the king in the queen's room.",
   "i": 12,
   "zh": "我去王后的房间见国王。"
  },
  {
   "start": 50.001,
   "end": 54.0,
   "en": "And there's another room with a real dinosaur.",
   "i": 13,
   "zh": "还有另一个房间里有一只真正的恐龙。"
  },
  {
   "start": 54.001,
   "end": 57.0,
   "en": "Wow, dinosaur!",
   "i": 14,
   "zh": "哇，恐龙！"
  },
  {
   "start": 61.0,
   "end": 63.0,
   "en": "Hello Mummy Pig.",
   "i": 15,
   "zh": "猪妈妈你好。"
  },
  {
   "start": 63.001,
   "end": 64.0,
   "en": "Hello Miss Rabbit.",
   "i": 16,
   "zh": "兔小姐你好。"
  },
  {
   "start": 64.001,
   "end": 66.0,
   "en": "How many tickets please?",
   "i": 17,
   "zh": "请问多少张票？"
  },
  {
   "start": 66.0,
   "end": 68.0,
   "en": "Two adults and two children.",
   "i": 18,
   "zh": "两个成人和两个孩子。"
  },
  {
   "start": 68.85,
   "end": 71.0,
   "en": "Dinosaur.",
   "i": 19,
   "zh": "恐龙。"
  },
  {
   "start": 73.0,
   "end": 75.0,
   "en": "And a dinosaur.",
   "i": 20,
   "zh": "还有一只恐龙。"
  },
  {
   "start": 77.0,
   "end": 79.599,
   "en": "Peppa wants to see the room full of things that",
   "i": 21,
   "zh": "佩奇想看到房间里堆满了那些东西"
  },
  {
   "start": 79.623,
   "end": 82.012,
   "en": "belonged to kings and queens from long ago.",
   "i": 22,
   "zh": "很久以前就属于国王和王后。"
  },
  {
   "start": 82.013,
   "end": 85.0,
   "en": "Wow, dinosaur!",
   "i": 23,
   "zh": "哇，恐龙！"
  },
  {
   "start": 85.274,
   "end": 88.0,
   "en": "But George wants to see the real dinosaur.",
   "i": 24,
   "zh": "但乔治想看看真正的恐龙。"
  },
  {
   "start": 89.0,
   "end": 93.0,
   "en": "Don't worry George, we will see the dinosaur next.",
   "i": 25,
   "zh": "别担心乔治，我们接下来会看到恐龙。"
  },
  {
   "start": 94.449,
   "end": 98.0,
   "en": "Peppa, these are all the things that the queen had a long time ago.",
   "i": 26,
   "zh": "佩奇，这些都是女王很久以前就有的东西了。"
  },
  {
   "start": 99.149,
   "end": 103.0,
   "en": "This is the queen's special chair. It's called a throne.",
   "i": 27,
   "zh": "这是女王专用的椅子。它被称为王座。"
  },
  {
   "start": 104.049,
   "end": 106.0,
   "en": "It's beautiful.",
   "i": 28,
   "zh": "很漂亮。"
  },
  {
   "start": 107.349,
   "end": 109.0,
   "en": "This is the queen's dress.",
   "i": 29,
   "zh": "这是女王的礼服。"
  },
  {
   "start": 109.001,
   "end": 111.0,
   "en": "It's so pretty.",
   "i": 30,
   "zh": "太漂亮了。"
  },
  {
   "start": 113.0,
   "end": 117.0,
   "en": "Look Peppa, this is the queen's golden crown.",
   "i": 31,
   "zh": "看佩奇，这是女王的金冠。"
  },
  {
   "start": 117.001,
   "end": 121.0,
   "en": "Wow, what lovely things.",
   "i": 32,
   "zh": "哇，多可爱的东西啊。"
  },
  {
   "start": 121.925,
   "end": 125.0,
   "en": "Mummy, where is the queen's television?",
   "i": 33,
   "zh": "妈妈，女王的电视在哪里？"
  },
  {
   "start": 126.099,
   "end": 128.0,
   "en": "They didn't have television then.",
   "i": 34,
   "zh": "那时他们没有电视。"
  },
  {
   "start": 128.001,
   "end": 130.0,
   "en": "No television?",
   "i": 35,
   "zh": "没有电视？"
  },
  {
   "start": 130.001,
   "end": 132.0,
   "en": "But they did have computers.",
   "i": 36,
   "zh": "但他们确实有电脑。"
  },
  {
   "start": 132.001,
   "end": 135.0,
   "en": "No, they didn't have computers either.",
   "i": 37,
   "zh": "不，他们也没有电脑。"
  },
  {
   "start": 136.1,
   "end": 138.0,
   "en": "What did they do all day?",
   "i": 38,
   "zh": "他们一整天都做了什么？"
  },
  {
   "start": 140.0,
   "end": 146.0,
   "en": "Mummy, if I was the queen, I would eat as much cake as I wanted.",
   "i": 39,
   "zh": "妈妈，如果我是女王，我想吃多少蛋糕就吃多少。"
  },
  {
   "start": 146.001,
   "end": 149.0,
   "en": "Peppa imagines being a queen.",
   "i": 40,
   "zh": "佩奇想象成为女王。"
  },
  {
   "start": 155.95,
   "end": 158.0,
   "en": "Mmm, delicious.",
   "i": 41,
   "zh": "嗯，好吃。"
  },
  {
   "start": 159.0,
   "end": 161.0,
   "en": "Is there anything else you would care for Queen Peppa?",
   "i": 42,
   "zh": "您还有什么想关心佩奇女王的吗？"
  },
  {
   "start": 161.001,
   "end": 164.0,
   "en": "Yes, more cake please.",
   "i": 43,
   "zh": "是的，请再来点蛋糕。"
  },
  {
   "start": 164.001,
   "end": 166.0,
   "en": "Of course.",
   "i": 44,
   "zh": "当然。"
  },
  {
   "start": 166.849,
   "end": 169.0,
   "en": "Come on everyone.",
   "i": 45,
   "zh": "大家加油。"
  },
  {
   "start": 169.35,
   "end": 171.0,
   "en": "Coming Daddy.",
   "i": 46,
   "zh": "爸爸来了。"
  },
  {
   "start": 171.799,
   "end": 175.0,
   "en": "Daddy, I'm Queen Peppa.",
   "i": 47,
   "zh": "爸爸，我是佩奇女王。"
  },
  {
   "start": 175.375,
   "end": 178.0,
   "en": "You must bow when you speak to me.",
   "i": 48,
   "zh": "跟我说话时必须鞠躬。"
  },
  {
   "start": 178.001,
   "end": 182.0,
   "en": "Oh, I'm most terribly sorry your Royal Highness.",
   "i": 49,
   "zh": "哦，我非常抱歉殿下。"
  },
  {
   "start": 182.05,
   "end": 184.0,
   "en": "And what do you do?",
   "i": 50,
   "zh": "那你做什么？"
  },
  {
   "start": 184.001,
   "end": 186.0,
   "en": "I'm your Daddy.",
   "i": 51,
   "zh": "我是你的爸爸。"
  },
  {
   "start": 186.2,
   "end": 188.0,
   "en": "That must be very interesting.",
   "i": 52,
   "zh": "那一定很有趣。"
  },
  {
   "start": 188.001,
   "end": 191.0,
   "en": "Yes, it's very interesting.",
   "i": 53,
   "zh": "是的，这很有趣。"
  },
  {
   "start": 191.15,
   "end": 193.0,
   "en": "And what room is this?",
   "i": 54,
   "zh": "这是什么房间？"
  },
  {
   "start": 193.001,
   "end": 196.0,
   "en": "This is the dinosaur room.",
   "i": 55,
   "zh": "这是恐龙室。"
  },
  {
   "start": 196.001,
   "end": 198.0,
   "en": "The dinosaur room?",
   "i": 56,
   "zh": "恐龙室？"
  },
  {
   "start": 198.001,
   "end": 201.0,
   "en": "George, this is the dinosaur room.",
   "i": 57,
   "zh": "乔治，这是恐龙室。"
  },
  {
   "start": 201.001,
   "end": 203.0,
   "en": "Dinosaur!",
   "i": 58,
   "zh": "恐龙！"
  },
  {
   "start": 204.0,
   "end": 206.0,
   "en": "Where is the dinosaur?",
   "i": 59,
   "zh": "恐龙在哪里？"
  },
  {
   "start": 206.001,
   "end": 208.0,
   "en": "He's somewhere in the room.",
   "i": 60,
   "zh": "他在房间的某个地方。"
  },
  {
   "start": 208.001,
   "end": 212.0,
   "en": "I can't see him. He must be very small.",
   "i": 61,
   "zh": "我看不到他。他一定很小。"
  },
  {
   "start": 212.35,
   "end": 216.0,
   "en": "Actually Peppa, he's very big.",
   "i": 62,
   "zh": "其实佩奇，他很大。"
  },
  {
   "start": 218.0,
   "end": 220.0,
   "en": "Wow!",
   "i": 63,
   "zh": "哇！"
  },
  {
   "start": 220.001,
   "end": 224.0,
   "en": "These are the bones of a real dinosaur.",
   "i": 64,
   "zh": "这些是真正恐龙的骨头。"
  },
  {
   "start": 225.1,
   "end": 227.0,
   "en": "Dinosaur!",
   "i": 65,
   "zh": "恐龙！"
  },
  {
   "start": 230.774,
   "end": 234.0,
   "en": "George imagines being a big dinosaur.",
   "i": 66,
   "zh": "乔治想象自己是一只大恐龙。"
  },
  {
   "start": 239.0,
   "end": 241.0,
   "en": "Oh!",
   "i": 67,
   "zh": "哦！"
  },
  {
   "start": 241.001,
   "end": 243.0,
   "en": "It's a dinosaur!",
   "i": 68,
   "zh": "这是一只恐龙！"
  },
  {
   "start": 243.001,
   "end": 245.0,
   "en": "Help! Help!",
   "i": 69,
   "zh": "救命！帮助！"
  },
  {
   "start": 251.2,
   "end": 255.0,
   "en": "The dinosaur room is George's favourite room.",
   "i": 70,
   "zh": "恐龙室是乔治最喜欢的房间。"
  },
  {
   "start": 257.0,
   "end": 261.0,
   "en": "My favourite room is the king and queen's room.",
   "i": 71,
   "zh": "我最喜欢的房间是特大号床间和大号床间。"
  },
  {
   "start": 261.001,
   "end": 265.0,
   "en": "And it looks as if Daddy Pig is already in his favourite room.",
   "i": 72,
   "zh": "看来猪爸爸已经在他最喜欢的房间里了。"
  },
  {
   "start": 265.025,
   "end": 267.0,
   "en": "Which room is that, Mummy?",
   "i": 73,
   "zh": "妈妈，那是哪个房间？"
  },
  {
   "start": 267.001,
   "end": 269.0,
   "en": "The room with the cakes in.",
   "i": 74,
   "zh": "有蛋糕的房间。"
  },
  {
   "start": 269.001,
   "end": 273.0,
   "en": "Daddy Pig's favourite room is the museum cafe.",
   "i": 75,
   "zh": "猪爸爸最喜欢的房间是博物馆咖啡厅。"
  },
  {
   "start": 274.1,
   "end": 276.0,
   "en": "Come on, tuck in.",
   "i": 76,
   "zh": "来吧，吃东西。"
  },
  {
   "start": 276.925,
   "end": 279.0,
   "en": "Oh, yes.",
   "i": 77,
   "zh": "哦，是的。"
  },
  {
   "start": 279.001,
   "end": 281.0,
   "en": "This is a very nice room.",
   "i": 78,
   "zh": "这是一个非常好的房间。"
  },
